**command.hpp does declare controller console-command registration.**

## Interface

`register_commands(const context&, runtime&) -> void` registers fixed-order console commands.

## ABI

`runtime` reaches handlers through a documented file-scope process-lifetime pointer; engine command storage is process-lifetime. Depends on `context`, `types.hpp`, `utility.hpp`.